{% block content %}{% raw %}
<section class="hv-hero" data-screen-label="Hero">
  <div class="container hv-hero-grid">
    <div class="hv-hero-copy">
      <h1>Tailor-made trips to Thailand, designed for you</h1>
      <p class="hv-sub">I&#x27;ll help you build your ideal itinerary, based on what you love, your pace and your budget, drawing on my local experience. You save hours of research and your trip costs less than with an agency.</p>
      <div class="hero-btns">
        <a class="btn btn-teal btn-lg" href="/en/contact/" data-magnetic><span>Get my free quote <svg class="arrow" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg" href="/en/services/"><span>Discover my services</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hv-hero-art" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="hv-art-main"><img fetchpriority="high" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 50vw, 60vw" src="/images/IMG_1369.jpg" alt=""></div>
      <div class="hv-art-side"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" sizes="280px" src="/images/galerie/phang-nga.jpg" alt=""></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-pad">
  <div class="container hv-split">
    <div class="hv-arch"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/anais-smoothies.jpg" alt="Anaïs holding two mango smoothies at a market stall"></div>
    <div class="hv-text">
      <h2>I&#x27;m Anaïs, your travel planner in Thailand</h2>
      <p class="lead">I&#x27;ve been living in Thailand for over three years, helping travelers plan their trip with ease and peace of mind.</p>
      <p>Choosing regions, seasons, transport, accommodation, activities… planning a trip to Southeast Asia can quickly become a headache. My role: turn your project into a clear itinerary, tailored to your style, your budget and what you love.</p>
      <a class="text-link mt-s" href="/en/a-propos/">Learn more about my story <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-pad hv-audience">
  <div class="container hv-aud-grid">
    <div class="hv-aud-photo"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/galerie/phang-nga.jpg" alt="Viewpoint over a bay and its limestone peaks"></div>
    <div class="hv-aud-panel">
      <h2>My service is right for you if…</h2>
      <ul class="hv-aud-list">
        <li>You want to plan a trip to Thailand but don&#x27;t know where to start.</li>
        <li>You want to avoid common mistakes and tourist traps.</li>
        <li>You want authentic spots and local tips, off the beaten path.</li>
        <li>You want a well-organized trip while keeping the freedom to choose.</li>
      </ul>
      <a class="btn btn-teal mt-l" href="/en/contact/"><span>Get my free quote</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% endraw %}{% include "home-map.njk" %}{% raw %}

<div class="hv-gal-link">
  <a class="text-link" href="/en/galerie/">
    See the full gallery
    <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
  </a>
</div>


<section class="section-pad hv-why">
  <div class="container hv-why-grid hv-why-v2">
    <div class="hv-why-photo"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 45vw, 100vw" src="/images/IMG_5300.jpg" alt="Anaïs stroking an elephant in an ethical elephant sanctuary"></div>
    <div class="hv-why-text">
    <div class="hv-head">
      <h2>Why work with a travel planner?</h2>
      <p>Not a travel agency, not a standardized tour. Personal support, from your first message to your return home.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hv-cols">
      <div class="hv-why-item" data-reveal><h3>Not a packaged trip</h3><p class="hv-why-short">A trip built around your pace and what you love.</p><p class="hv-why-long">An agency sells the same tour to everyone. Your itinerary starts from you: your pace, what you love, what you'd rather avoid.</p></div>
      <div class="hv-why-item" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1"><h3>The best prices, found for you</h3><p class="hv-why-short">I compare everything, you book at the direct price.</p><p class="hv-why-long">Flights, hotels, activities, transport, even where to eat. I compare everything and you book at the direct price, with no agency margin.</p></div>
      <div class="hv-why-item" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2"><h3>We actually talk</h3><p class="hv-why-short">Calls to plan it, WhatsApp throughout the trip.</p><p class="hv-why-long">Calls to build the trip together, step by step, for as long as it takes. Then I stay on WhatsApp for the whole trip.</p></div>
      <div class="hv-why-item" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="3"><h3>Someone who lives there</h3><p class="hv-why-short">On Koh Lanta since 2023, I know it from the inside.</p><p class="hv-why-long">In Koh Lanta since February 2023. Seasons, routes and good addresses, I know them from the inside.</p></div>
    </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-pad hv-formules hv-band pricing pricing-compact">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hv-head">
      <h2 class="sig-title">My travel <span class="sig-script">packages</span></h2>
      <p>Every trip is unique. Choose the package that suits you — and let's adapt it together.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="formules">
      <a class="formule featured" href="/en/services/#formules">
        <span class="badge">Most popular</span>
        <h3>Solo / Duo</h3>
        <p class="aud">Up to 2 people</p>
        <div class="price"><span class="price-chf" data-chf="40">40 CHF</span> <small>/ day</small></div>
        <p class="price-note">per day of organized travel</p>
        <p class="diff">Transport and accommodation selected, 2 to 4 options per stop</p>
      </a>
      <a class="formule" href="/en/services/#formules">
        <h3>Light</h3>
        <p class="aud">Independent travelers</p>
        <div class="price"><span class="price-chf" data-chf="35">35 CHF</span> <small>/ day</small></div>
        <p class="price-note">per day of organized travel</p>
        <p class="diff">No accommodation selection</p>
      </a>
      <a class="formule" href="/en/services/#formules">
        <h3>Family</h3>
        <p class="aud">Up to 4 people</p>
        <div class="price"><span class="price-chf" data-chf="43">43 CHF</span> <small>/ day</small></div>
        <p class="price-note">per day of organized travel</p>
        <p class="diff">Everything in Solo / Duo, plus activities suited to children</p>
      </a>
    </div>
    <p class="hv-example">Real example: 2 weeks as a couple = <span class="price-chf" data-chf="560">560 CHF</span> total, or about ~<span class="price-chf" data-chf="20">20 CHF</span> per person per day — often offset by the savings you make on the ground.</p>
    <p class="text-center mt-l" style="color:var(--ink-mute)"><a class="text-link" href="/en/services/#formules">Package details and prices</a> · Group trip, honeymoon, surprise getaway? <a class="text-link" href="/en/contact/">Write to me</a></p>
    <span class="currency-note" hidden>Indicative rate, updated daily — CHF remains the reference currency.</span>
  </div>
</section>


<section class="section-pad hv-process">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hv-head">
      <h2>How it works</h2>
      <p>Four steps, from our first exchange to your return home.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sig-route" data-reveal>{% endraw %}{{ sig.routeLine() }}{% raw %}<ol class="hsteps sig-route-list" data-accordion data-accordion-multi data-accordion-mobile>
      <li class="hstep fold"><span class="sig-num">1</span>{% endraw %}{{ fold.head("hstep-1", "Discovery call") }}{% raw %}<div class="fold-body" id="hstep-1"><p>Free and no obligation. We talk about what you want, your budget and your dates.</p></div></li>
      <li class="hstep fold"><span class="sig-num">2</span>{% endraw %}{{ fold.head("hstep-2", "Tailor-made itinerary") }}{% raw %}<div class="fold-body" id="hstep-2"><p>I put together one or two proposals tailored to your project, with a clear quote.</p></div></li>
      <li class="hstep fold"><span class="sig-num">3</span>{% endraw %}{{ fold.head("hstep-3", "Travel journal") }}{% raw %}<div class="fold-body" id="hstep-3"><p>You receive your complete guide with everything you need to book with confidence.</p></div></li>
      <li class="hstep fold"><span class="sig-num">4</span>{% endraw %}{{ fold.head("hstep-4", "Enjoy your trip!") }}{% raw %}<div class="fold-body" id="hstep-4"><p>I stay available 7 days a week during your stay. All you have to do is enjoy.</p></div></li>
    </ol>{% endraw %}{{ sig.plane("sig-route-end") }}{% raw %}</div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-pad hv-testi bg-navy">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hv-head">
      <h2 id="avis-titre">What my travelers say</h2>
      <a class="g-badge" href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/F81WUgeET6vPxjNs8" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="#fff" d="M21.6 12.2c0-.7-.1-1.4-.2-2H12v3.8h5.4a4.6 4.6 0 01-2 3v2.5h3.2c1.9-1.7 3-4.3 3-7.3z"/><path fill="#fff" opacity=".85" d="M12 22c2.7 0 5-.9 6.6-2.4l-3.2-2.5c-.9.6-2 1-3.4 1-2.6 0-4.8-1.8-5.6-4.1H3.1v2.6A10 10 0 0012 22z"/><path fill="#fff" opacity=".7" d="M6.4 14a6 6 0 010-3.9V7.5H3.1a10 10 0 000 9z"/><path fill="#fff" opacity=".85" d="M12 6c1.5 0 2.8.5 3.8 1.5l2.8-2.8A10 10 0 003.1 7.5l3.3 2.6C7.2 7.8 9.4 6 12 6z"/></svg>{% endraw %}<span>{{ business.googleRating }}/5 {{ 'reviews.onGoogle' | t(lang) }}{% if business.googleReviewCount %}, {{ business.googleReviewCount }} {{ 'reviews.count' | t(lang) }}{% endif %}</span>{% raw %}</a>
    </div>
    <ul class="reviews" aria-labelledby="avis-titre">
      <li><div class="tcard"><div class="quote">"</div><div class="stars"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l2.9 6.1 6.6.9-4.8 4.6 1.2 6.6L12 17.8 6.1 20.8l1.2-6.6L2.5 9l6.6-.9z"/></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l2.9 6.1 6.6.9-4.8 4.6 1.2 6.6L12 17.8 6.1 20.8l1.2-6.6L2.5 9l6.6-.9z"/></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l2.9 6.1 6.6.9-4.8 4.6 1.2 6.6L12 17.8 6.1 20.8l1.2-6.6L2.5 9l6.6-.9z"/></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l2.9 6.1 6.6.9-4.8 4.6 1.2 6.6L12 17.8 6.1 20.8l1.2-6.6L2.5 9l6.6-.9z"/></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l2.9 6.1 6.6.9-4.8 4.6 1.2 6.6L12 17.8 6.1 20.8l1.2-6.6L2.5 9l6.6-.9z"/></svg></div><p>A huge thank you to Anaïs! She knows all the best spots: local restaurants, top-notch excursions, unbeatable-value activities. An exceptional vacation while saving real money!</p><div class="who"><strong>Sophie</strong><span>Solo trip · Koh Lanta</span></div></div></li>
      <li><div class="tcard"><div class="quote">"</div><div class="stars"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l2.9 6.1 6.6.9-4.8 4.6 1.2 6.6L12 17.8 6.1 20.8l1.2-6.6L2.5 9l6.6-.9z"/></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l2.9 6.1 6.6.9-4.8 4.6 1.2 6.6L12 17.8 6.1 20.8l1.2-6.6L2.5 9l6.6-.9z"/></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l2.9 6.1 6.6.9-4.8 4.6 1.2 6.6L12 17.8 6.1 20.8l1.2-6.6L2.5 9l6.6-.9z"/></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l2.9 6.1 6.6.9-4.8 4.6 1.2 6.6L12 17.8 6.1 20.8l1.2-6.6L2.5 9l6.6-.9z"/></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l2.9 6.1 6.6.9-4.8 4.6 1.2 6.6L12 17.8 6.1 20.8l1.2-6.6L2.5 9l6.6-.9z"/></svg></div><p>Anaïs put together an unforgettable tailor-made trip to Indonesia for us! She really listened to what we wanted for Bali, Lombok and the surrounding islands. We traveled completely stress-free.</p><div class="who"><strong>Timothé</strong><span>Trip as a couple · Bali &amp; Lombok</span></div></div></li>
      <li><div class="tcard"><div class="quote">"</div><div class="stars"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l2.9 6.1 6.6.9-4.8 4.6 1.2 6.6L12 17.8 6.1 20.8l1.2-6.6L2.5 9l6.6-.9z"/></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l2.9 6.1 6.6.9-4.8 4.6 1.2 6.6L12 17.8 6.1 20.8l1.2-6.6L2.5 9l6.6-.9z"/></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l2.9 6.1 6.6.9-4.8 4.6 1.2 6.6L12 17.8 6.1 20.8l1.2-6.6L2.5 9l6.6-.9z"/></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l2.9 6.1 6.6.9-4.8 4.6 1.2 6.6L12 17.8 6.1 20.8l1.2-6.6L2.5 9l6.6-.9z"/></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l2.9 6.1 6.6.9-4.8 4.6 1.2 6.6L12 17.8 6.1 20.8l1.2-6.6L2.5 9l6.6-.9z"/></svg></div><p>Thanks to Anaïs's invaluable advice, we discovered Koh Lanta and Bangkok. Working with a travel planner was amazing: we saved time and money, with zero hassle!</p><div class="who"><strong>Patrick</strong><span>Trip as a couple · Koh Lanta &amp; Bangkok</span></div></div></li>
      <li><div class="tcard"><div class="quote">"</div><div class="stars"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l2.9 6.1 6.6.9-4.8 4.6 1.2 6.6L12 17.8 6.1 20.8l1.2-6.6L2.5 9l6.6-.9z"/></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l2.9 6.1 6.6.9-4.8 4.6 1.2 6.6L12 17.8 6.1 20.8l1.2-6.6L2.5 9l6.6-.9z"/></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l2.9 6.1 6.6.9-4.8 4.6 1.2 6.6L12 17.8 6.1 20.8l1.2-6.6L2.5 9l6.6-.9z"/></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l2.9 6.1 6.6.9-4.8 4.6 1.2 6.6L12 17.8 6.1 20.8l1.2-6.6L2.5 9l6.6-.9z"/></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l2.9 6.1 6.6.9-4.8 4.6 1.2 6.6L12 17.8 6.1 20.8l1.2-6.6L2.5 9l6.6-.9z"/></svg></div><p>Anaïs gave us a dream trip that matched our expectations perfectly. Everything just works with her — you can trust her completely!</p><div class="who"><strong>Céline</strong><span>Family trip · Thailand</span></div></div></li>
    </ul>
    <div class="hv-testi-more">
      <a class="btn btn-ghost on-dark" href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/F81WUgeET6vPxjNs8" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span>Read my reviews on Google <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<section class="section-pad hv-girls hv-band girls-sand">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="split">
      <div class="girls-mosaic">
        <div class="girls-mosaic-inner">
          <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/girls/groupe-ao-nang.jpg" alt="Three Girls Trip participants facing the Krabi cliffs" class="gm-main">

        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="split-text">
        <h2>Girls Trips, a Zwald specialty</h2>
        <hr class="divider">
        <p class="lead">Small-group trips of 4 to 8 women, to experience Thailand differently, whether you come alone, with a friend or as a group that already exists.</p>
        <ul class="feature-list mt-m">
          <li><span class="tick"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.8"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span>Koh Lanta and Krabi: sea, beaches and nature</li>
          <li><span class="tick"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.8"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span>Local experiences: cooking, massage, snorkeling</li>
          <li><span class="tick"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.8"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span>Anaïs is with you on site</li>
          <li><span class="tick"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.8"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span>All year round, dates are chosen with the group</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="btn btn-teal mt-l" href="/en/girls-trips/"><span>Discover the Girls Trips <svg class="arrow" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


{% endraw %}{% include "other-services.njk" %}{% raw %}

{% endraw %}{% include "newsletter.njk" %}{% raw %}

<section class="cta-band cta-sand hv-cta">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Ready to plan <em>your trip</em>?</h2>
    <div>
    <p>Dreaming of a stress-free, perfectly organized trip to Thailand? I'll help you create a trip that feels like you, without blowing your budget.</p>
    <div class="btns">
      <a class="btn btn-teal btn-lg" href="/en/contact/" data-magnetic><span>Get my free quote <svg class="arrow" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg" href="/en/services/"><span>See my services</span></a>
    </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% endraw %}{% endblock %}

